  "title": "Last stop, Suomenlinna",
  "date": "2026-10-27T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Last stop, Suomenlinna\n\nSuomenlinna is a sea fortress in Finland. It was built by sweden and then Russia.\n\nThe first time I went to Finland. I met a group of people, they went to hiking in Suomenlinna. But I do not have time to go with them. So this place became my must visit for my second visit to Finland.\n\nTo go to the island, ferries are needed. It is included in HSL A-B ticket. It takes 30min for the trip.\n\nIf you are a history fan or a weapon fun, you will like this place.\n\nFor me, this place feels more like the Great Wall. Like the place King's Gate, you can go up down through the fortress. It was so much fun.",
